tom)) (uuid "20b469df-50d6-5acd-a24e-2ca59193de75")) (wire (pts (xy 1163.32 955.04) (xy 1097.28 955.04)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "aa5c0f2c-a6ad-5605-8894-405d6d756fad")) (label "DI22_LOGIC" (at 1097.28 955.04 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2c8e5e20-98ca-5b8f-bdb7-74bef33e21a6")) (wire (pts (xy 1163.32 960.12) (xy 1097.28 960.12)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "eed0420d-d4a5-56d9-b35e-4905636b376b")) (label "DI23_LOGIC" (at 1097.28 960.12 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "85200161-adca-5ff1-bf21-49a77b1fda50")) (text "MOTHERBOARD: 24 GENERAL DI - 12 ISO1212 - NEW SOURCE r0.1 / NOT A PCB RELEASE" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3515b6e2-9d16-567c-a21e-8da73254662e")) (text "Fixed sinking inputs: PNP or contact to qualified sensor positive. 0-30V, LOW<=5V / HIGH>=15V targets. NPN/12V/AUTO mode not implemented.\nFIELD_B_0V never joins LOGIC_GND here. Each SUB pin needs a separate floating 2x2mm copper island; no ground or inter-island connection." (at 20.32 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d5918b4d-ea18-5f74-84cc-e1be80325ce2")) (text "All 24 DI are general channels, independent of 12 motor alarms and 2 fast probes. No PROBE/HOME/ALM assignment is consumed here.\nEN tied to IO_3V3. Powered open reads LOW. Unpowered/brownout is UNDETERMINED; bias is not guaranteed fail-safe.\nAcquisition, rail/freshness/CRC validity, sensor-power limiters/measurement, TVS/cable qualification and connectors are unfinished parent circuits." (at 20.32 800.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5adf4a32-f308-5a36-ac67-c1c687db0584")) (text "XDI9/10 supply contacts are one shared 0.20A group, not 0.20A each. Three groups reserve 0.60A total under frozen IS-1.\nSensor supply is an UNIMPLEMENTED boundary: no source/current limiter/telemetry is fitted by this sheet. All boundary symbols excluded from PCB/BOM.\nRTHR*C is a screen, not complete input propagation delay. No board isolation/EMC/temperature or safety certification is established." (at 20.32 980.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ef62229c-cb67-52ea-91b7-6a5e94be2bf6")))
